  Logit Diff         -2.4787    1.3132    0.9072   -0.3960    1.3924    2.4423    2.9724   0.0%  1.0000   -4.18
  KL Div              1.9814    0.1953    0.1991    0.0148    0.1118    0.5272    0.6787   0.0%  1.0000   -8.97
